  "notes": "A technical term most commonly found in engineering, computing, and science. Compared to コントロール, {制御|せいぎょ} sounds more technical and formal, and is preferred in written and academic contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {制御|せいぎょ}する — to control, to regulate\n- {制御|せいぎょ}を{失|うしな}う — to lose control\n- {制御|せいぎょ}{装置|そうち} — control device\n- {制御|せいぎょ}システム — control system\n- {制御|せいぎょ}{盤|ばん} — control panel\n- {遠隔|えんかく}{制御|せいぎょ} — remote control",
